# Google Docs Lite - Frontend Environment Variables
# FRONT END SAFE ONLY: Use only the Project URL and Anon/Publishable Key.
# NEVER put service_role or secret keys in this file!

# 1. Sign up / Log in to https://supabase.com
# 2. Create a new project (e.g. "google-docs-lite")
# 3. Under Project Settings -> API, copy Project URL and Project API Anon Key
# 4. In Supabase SQL Editor, run the contents of `supabase-schema.sql`
# 5. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your values below:

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.your-anon-key-here
